Subject: [PATCH 4/5] AI button and Word's ribbon collapse

- WordApp::ai_button shows a sparkle button beside Comments for hosts that
  offer AI; clicks queue "ai" in WordApp::host_events.
- The ribbon has Word's ^ at its bottom-right to collapse it to its tabs.
  While collapsed, clicking a tab opens the ribbon over the page until you
  click elsewhere or press Esc; its pin keeps it open.
